[[Skill type]]. This type of skill is unique in that they are activated not from the [[skill bar]], but by selecting the corresponding [[title]] to be displayed. Once selected, they grant a [[passive]] effect that cannot be removed.

Only one can be active at a time as it is only possible to pick one title to display, and most notably, they will not only affect its activator but also all their [[hero]]es. Like other [[title skill]]s, titles are all tied to their respective [[title track]]s, rather than [[profession]] attribute rank.

